4,Puluwatese language and alphabet,https://www.omniglot.com/writing/puluwatese.htm,"Puluwatese is a Micronesian language spoken mainly in Chuuk State in the Federated States of Micronesia on the islands of Poluwat, Pollap, Pulusuk and Tamtam.",Puluwatese,Austronesian
5,"Puluwatese Language (PUW) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map, Endangered Level & Official Use | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/puw/,Puluwatese is a stable indigenous language of Micronesia. It belongs to the Austronesian language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Puluwatese,Austronesian
